---
description: Paddock (F1 career sim) project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md` and `docs/NEXT.md` in this repo.

- Determinism first: everything random goes through `src/engine/rng.ts`; player inputs may change odds/times but
  never the number of random draws. Mini-game scores (0-1) are stored in `MomentChoice.q`, `Command.crew/unsafe`,
  `RaceInput.launch`, `CarPlan.laps` and carried by `LiveAnswers` so the saved re-sim matches the live race.
- After each batch: `npx tsc --noEmit -p . && npm test`, commit (one plain sentence) and push to `main`.
- UI: big, solid colours, high contrast, plain labels, NBA GM style. Never gradients, glass, emoji in headings,
  Inter, coloured-border cards, three-icon rows, fade-on-hover/fade-in-on-scroll, em dashes in UI copy.
- `/Users/williamliu/Coding/nba-gm` is a reference: read it, never edit it.
- Update `CLAUDE.md` / `docs/NEXT.md` when a feature lands.
